# a kit's hits: each sound on a step has its own chance and tricks. A held kit step's KNOB 3 and ARP reach the sound
# shown (PRESETS picks among the step's sounds); the others keep theirs. A step's own (an older project's) goes to its
# sounds when one of them is first given its own, so the others play as they did
wait 300
expect trk 1
hits 1 1 1 x...x...x...
hits 1 1 2 x.......x...
hits 1 1 3 x.x.x.x.
# step 1 held with the snare shown: KNOB 3 its chance, ARP + KNOB 1 its flam; the kick's and the hat's stay
tapkey b1
wait 40
key w0 down
wait 40
turn K3 50
wait 20
expect kcond1.1.1.2 50
expect kcond1.1.1.1 0
expect kcond1.1.1.3 0
shot hit_chance.png
tap ARP
turn K1 15
wait 20
shot hit_flam.png
key w0 up
wait 20
expect ktrick1.1.1.2 15
expect ktrick1.1.1.1 0
expect ktrick1.1.1.3 0
expect comp 1 1 0
# PRESETS with the step held: the next of its sounds (the hat), and its own chance, 1:2 (past 99 %)
key w0 down
wait 40
turn PRESET 1
wait 20
turn K3 100
wait 20
shot hit_hat.png
key w0 up
wait 20
expect kcond1.1.1.3 100
expect kcond1.1.1.2 50
expect kcond1.1.1.1 0
# the sound taken off the step: its settings there go (back on: plain)
key w0 down
wait 40
tapkey b2
tapkey b2
key w0 up
wait 20
expect kcond1.1.1.3 0
# a step's own trick (as an older project has): every sound on it plays it; the kick given its own chance, the
# snare keeps the multiply, as its own now
trick 1 1 9 multiply 3
expect comp 1 9 3
tapkey b0
wait 40
key w8 down
wait 40
turn K3 25
wait 20
key w8 up
wait 20
expect comp 1 9 0
expect kcond1.1.9.1 25
expect ktrick1.1.9.1 3
expect ktrick1.1.9.2 3
expect kcond1.1.9.2 0
# it plays: the snare's flam on step 1 and the multiplies on step 9 (hits counted)
tap PLAY
wait 1200
tap PLAY
expect playing 0
# saved and loaded, the hits are kept
projsave 1 hits_test
reboot
wait 400
expect kcond1.1.1.2 50
expect ktrick1.1.1.2 15
expect kcond1.1.9.1 25
expect ktrick1.1.9.2 3
# the script's own: a sound's chance and trick by the commands
chance 1 1 5 75 1
trick 1 1 5 flam 4 1
expect kcond1.1.5.1 75
expect ktrick1.1.5.1 15
expect kcond1.1.5.3 0
